1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:04,716
Started on a tablet and want to continue on a phone? Here's how.

2
00:00:05,056 --> 00:00:09,160
No sign-up means progress is saved only in this browser.

3
00:00:11,936 --> 00:00:17,384
Before switching, tap Export backup on the parents' page to save a small file.

4
00:00:17,573 --> 00:00:23,045
Send that file to the new phone or tablet by email, WeChat or cloud drive.

5
00:00:23,812 --> 00:00:30,700
On the new device, open Hanzi Island, go to Settings, tap restore, choose the file, and carry on.

6
00:00:31,199 --> 00:00:35,303
One device can also keep separate progress for several children.

7
00:00:37,244 --> 00:00:41,924
Before clearing your browser, export a backup so nothing is lost.

8
00:00:42,496 --> 00:00:48,856
The address is on screen. Phone or tablet — what does your child use? Tell me in the comments.

